The correct answer is **option 1)0.5**

**Given:**

 f=-15cm,v=-7.5cm

**To find:**

magnification(m) 

**Formula used**:

{1over f}={1over v}-{1over u}



**Calculations:**

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/58d46f790d32dd2b262142a7e44cfdb0b8cf95e4db710402e72a24a961cb96c2.png] 

Here ,

{1over f}={1over v}-{1over u}

{1over (-15)}={1over (-7.5)}-{1over u}

{1over u}={1over (-7.5)}+{1over 15}

{1over u}={-10+5over75}

u=(75)/(-5)=-15cm

Magnification is given by,

m={vover u}

m={-7.5over -15}=0.5

Therefore, the magnification of the lens is 0**.5**
